<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Under Maintenance – AD21Store</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/output.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css" />
  <style>
    body { background: #0f1117; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-6">
  <div class="text-center max-w-md">
    <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl bg-yellow-500/10 border border-yellow-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-wrench text-yellow-400 text-4xl"></i>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-3">Under Maintenance</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      We're making some improvements to bring you a better experience.<br/>
      We'll be back shortly — thanks for your patience!
    </p>
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-yellow-500/10 border border-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-400 rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      We'll be back soon
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
